(7254943, 1128080, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really interesting subject but I felt the subject of the photograph was lost, rather than accentuated, by the framing effect.</td>', 'Really interesting subject but I felt the subject of the photograph was lost, rather than accentuated, by the framing effect.', '2014-08-25 09:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
