(7254946, 1128034, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really like the lines, light and B&amp;W effect on this. Personally I struggled with defining the actual frame.</td>', 'Really like the lines, light and B&W effect on this. Personally I struggled with defining the actual frame.', '2014-08-25 09:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
