(7254951, 1128163, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really like the insect,and the contrast of the purple ''frame'' highlights him well. I struggled, though, with the background; whilst the bike is part of the story (which I really like) I felt that it detracted from the insect itself.</td>', 'Really like the insect,and the contrast of the purple ''frame'' highlights him well. I struggled, though, with the background; whilst the bike is part of the story (which I really like) I felt that it detracted from the insect itself.', '2014-08-25 09:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254953, 1128162, 149964, '<td valign="top">I love the overall photograph but I''m split on this as a challenge entry....It''s clear that the structure is framing the buildings, but I''m not sure it either truly isolates or accentuates them</td>', 'I love the overall photograph but I''m split on this as a challenge entry....It''s clear that the structure is framing the buildings, but I''m not sure it either truly isolates or accentuates them', '2014-08-25 09:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254954, 1128032, 149964, '<td valign="top">Great bright colours and I like the overall photograph, but I wasn''t that convinced by the frame; isn''t really strong enough to either isolate or accentuate the subject itself - it would be almost as bright and bold without the flags.</td>', 'Great bright colours and I like the overall photograph, but I wasn''t that convinced by the frame; isn''t really strong enough to either isolate or accentuate the subject itself - it would be almost as bright and bold without the flags.', '2014-08-25 10:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254955, 1128175, 149964, '<td valign="top">This is lovely for its lines and subjects, however, I didn''t really think that it was ''framed'' in such a way to meet the challenge</td>', 'This is lovely for its lines and subjects, however, I didn''t really think that it was ''framed'' in such a way to meet the challenge', '2014-08-25 10:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254956, 1128030, 149964, '<td valign="top">I like the way your framing of the tower has isolated it and the angle that it has been taken from. The main drawback for me is that, even though framed, the tower was still not very dominant and a little ''lost'' in the overall picture.</td>', 'I like the way your framing of the tower has isolated it and the angle that it has been taken from. The main drawback for me is that, even though framed, the tower was still not very dominant and a little ''lost'' in the overall picture.', '2014-08-25 10:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254959, 1127753, 149964, '<td valign="top">I like the way the rocks have been used to frame the waterfall but would like to have seen the landscape a little sharper</td>', 'I like the way the rocks have been used to frame the waterfall but would like to have seen the landscape a little sharper', '2014-08-25 10:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254960, 1127805, 149964, '<td valign="top">The foliage and light work well to accentuate the bridge. Personally,  I would have like to have seen a little more bridge and a little less of the very dark corner in the bottom right.</td>', 'The foliage and light work well to accentuate the bridge. Personally,  I would have like to have seen a little more bridge and a little less of the very dark corner in the bottom right.', '2014-08-25 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254961, 1128127, 149964, '<td valign="top">I like the moodiness and lighting in this picture. However,  I think the subject is a little lost in all the lines, rather than accentuated.</td>', 'I like the moodiness and lighting in this picture. However,  I think the subject is a little lost in all the lines, rather than accentuated.', '2014-08-25 10:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254962, 1128128, 149964, '<td valign="top">I like the way the branches have been used to frame this but wonder if there could have been a little more of the subject and a little less of the leaves.</td>', 'I like the way the branches have been used to frame this but wonder if there could have been a little more of the subject and a little less of the leaves.', '2014-08-25 10:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254964, 1128058, 149964, '<td valign="top">A really beautiful subject and I like the idea that the trees are being used to frame it. However, I think the tree in the middle detracts a little  - but I don''t suppose they''d have let you chop it down just for the photo :-)</td>', 'A really beautiful subject and I like the idea that the trees are being used to frame it. However, I think the tree in the middle detracts a little  - but I don''t suppose they''d have let you chop it down just for the photo :-)', '2014-08-25 10:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254966, 1128067, 149964, '<td valign="top">Cute cat! (And that from someone who isn''t a cat lover!). It''s a shame that the frame cuts across its mouth I would have like to have see the ''frame lowered to frame the eyes/nose/mouth better</td>', 'Cute cat! (And that from someone who isn''t a cat lover!). It''s a shame that the frame cuts across its mouth I would have like to have see the ''frame lowered to frame the eyes/nose/mouth better', '2014-08-25 10:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7254967, 1128092, 149964, '<td valign="top">Aloveley subject and the framing definitely isolates the waterfall. I would have liked to have seen a little more waterfall though and wonder if cropping some of the foliage might have helped.</td>', 'Aloveley subject and the framing definitely isolates the waterfall. I would have liked to have seen a little more waterfall though and wonder if cropping some of the foliage might have helped.', '2014-08-25 10:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
