(7257212, 1128132, 19944, '<td valign="top">I saw that you weren''t sure why this scored what it did.  I gave it a 6, but I think a couple of things may have hurt you with the voters:  the lighting, which appears to be bright midday sun, and the out of focus top branch of the ''frame''.  I''d prefer to see that sharper.  Also, and I didn''t notice it until now, the second lemur''s rump may have distracted some voters.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-09-01 03:09:22.</i></td>', 'I saw that you weren''t sure why this scored what it did.  I gave it a 6, but I think a couple of things may have hurt you with the voters:  the lighting, which appears to be bright midday sun, and the out of focus top branch of the ''frame''.  I''d prefer to see that sharper.  Also, and I didn''t notice it until now, the second lemur''s rump may have distracted some voters.', '2014-09-01 04:08:59.000000', '2014-09-01 04:09:22.000000', 0),
