(7257231, 1127819, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Zita:</b></div><hr/><i> The ''sign'' - or whatever - at the bottom of the middle pane, on the bottom row, completely distracts.  Had that not been there - this one would have been near the tippy top of my choices.  How unfortunate. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>And where exactly is the ''tippy top'' of your list? a 4?<br/> <br/>Challenges Entered: 0<br/>Votes Cast: 42<br/>Avg Vote Cast: 2.8571<br/> <br/>Seems you didn''t think much of anyone''s work judging by your AVC, As a new member I hope you can find something you like here, something that can stimulate your photographic passion. Looking forward to seeing your work, seriously, no joke.<br/> <br/>Thanks for your honesty.</td>', 'Originally posted by Zita: The ''sign'' - or whatever - at the bottom of the middle pane, on the bottom row, completely distracts.  Had that not been there - this one would have been near the tippy top of my choices.  How unfortunate.   And where exactly is the ''tippy top'' of your list? a 4? Challenges Entered: 0Votes Cast: 42Avg Vote Cast: 2.8571 Seems you didn''t think much of anyone''s work judging by your AVC, As a new member I hope you can find something you like here, something that can stimulate your photographic passion. Looking forward to seeing your work, seriously, no joke. Thanks for your honesty.', '2014-09-01 04:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
