(7257410, 1128132, 30490, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much for the comments!  It really helps me when I get constructive criticism, and I try to improve in that area.  As part of the creative process you have to "love" your photo, or why would you submit it for a challenge?  I think after processing a photo it is easy to lose perspective and become blind to the flaws in the image.  Great comments help you keep it "real" and also help elevate your future images.  Thank you to all members that take the time to comment on the photos!  You are why we come to DPC and participate!</td>', 'Thank you so much for the comments!  It really helps me when I get constructive criticism, and I try to improve in that area.  As part of the creative process you have to "love" your photo, or why would you submit it for a challenge?  I think after processing a photo it is easy to lose perspective and become blind to the flaws in the image.  Great comments help you keep it "real" and also help elevate your future images.  Thank you to all members that take the time to comment on the photos!  You are why we come to DPC and participate!', '2014-09-01 13:59:53.000000', NULL, 0),
